        "original_id": "dcad3b33-daa3-546f-91bf-ed8e99a0daa5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Creation Entertainment, Fangoria Magazine\n- Places: Glendale, California; Los Angeles, California; Los Angeles County; California\n- Events: Fangoria's Weekend of Horrors\n- Topics: fan conventions, science fiction, horror, fantasy\n\nFacts:\n- Creation Entertainment is an American for-profit entertainment company located in Glendale, California.\n- In 2014, Glendale, California had an estimated population of 200,167, making it the third largest city in Los Angeles County and the 23rd-largest city in California.\n- Creation Entertainment produces fan conventions for films and television series, mainly in the science fiction, horror, and fantasy genres.\n- Fangoria's Weekend of Horrors was formerly produced in partnership with Creation Entertainment.\n- Fangoria's Weekend of Horrors is now owned exclusively by Fangoria Magazine and is held once annually in Los Angeles, California.",
